    {
      "implemented": false,
      "blocked_by": "No published nodal formula exists -- the Fisher et al. (2023) catalogue, which collects every known nodal fit, omits this family -- and no exact Weierstrass tiling has been built for it here.",
      "resume": "Two routes, both already identified in research/minimal_surfaces_status.md: derive a Fourier fit by the vSN structure-factor method, or build an exact Weierstrass tiling. The second is the one that already worked -- Schwarz H, CLP and CLP-handle ship in TPMS_EXACT precisely that way, which is why the older catalogue still lists them as blocked -- and the hexagonal-cell machinery (tpms2_LATTICE, TPMS2_HEX_LATTICE) is already in place and exercised by the self-test, waiting for exactly this."
    }
  ],
